摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"k8e.sh - OpenSource Agentic AI Sandbox Matrix","id":"gh:292529340","install_available":false,"language":"Go","name":"k8e","slug":"xiaods/k8e","topics":["agentic-ai","dsh-plugin","k8s","kubernetes","sandbox-playground"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"k8e.sh - OpenSource Agentic AI Sandbox Matrix"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"> **k8e.sh** — Open Source Agentic AI Sandbox Matrix. A **single binary under 100MB** that turns any"},{"id":"p2s2","text":" Linux host into a secure, isolated execution platform for AI agents — gVisor, Kata, or Firecracker "},{"id":"p2s3","text":"isolation, warm-pool fast starts, and an E2B-compatible API. Up and running in **60 seconds**."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*That's it. Your agentic sandbox matrix is ready. 🤖*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 🤖 What is K8E?"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**K8E** is the **Open Source Agentic AI Sandbox Matrix** — a self-hosted sandbox platform for runnin"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"g secure, isolated AI agent workloads at scale, packaged as a single binary under 100MB."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"As autonomous AI agents increasingly generate and execute untrusted code, robust sandboxing infrastr"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ucture is no longer optional. K8E ships everything needed to spin up a production-grade cluster in u"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"nder 60 seconds, with first-class primitives for agent isolation, resource governance, and persisten"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"t execution environments — purpose-built for the AI era."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> 🔒 **One cluster. Many agents. Zero trust between them.**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Sandbox Capabilities"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Capability | Description |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 🔒 **Hardware Isolation** | Pluggable runtimes: gVisor (default), Kata Containers, Firecracker micr"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"oVM |\n| 🌐 **Network Policies** | Bundled Cilium enforces the standard `networking.k8s.io/v1` Network"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"Policy API by default — plus eBPF `toFQDNs` egress control per session; `allowed_hosts` enforced via"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" `--cilium-dns-proxy` (KIP-16 M10) |\n| ⚖️ **Resource Quotas** | CPU/memory caps per agent session to"},{"id":"p11s5","text":" prevent runaway costs |\n| 💾 **Persistent Workspaces** | Every session carries a PVC workspace (1Gi "},{"id":"p11s6","text":"local-path by default); warm pods boot with their claim pre-provisioned — fast start *and* durable f"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"iles |\n| 🧠 **Warm Pool** | Pre-booted sandbox pods for sub-500ms session claim latency; application-"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"layer readiness handshake, adaptive sizing, per-session background-run caps |\n| 📸 **Content-Addresse"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"d Snapshots** | SHA-256 CAS layerstore with zstd compression, chunked multi-layer manifests, increme"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"ntal `--base` restore, server-side registry, autosquash (KIP-16 M2) |\n| 📜 **Exec Transcripts** | Fil"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"e-backed, windowed, offset-resumable command transcripts — `k8e-sandbox-cli log` (KIP-16 M4) |\n| 📊 *"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"*Observability** | Prometheus metrics, disk-only NDJSON event stream, process topology — `events` / "},{"id":"p11s13","text":"`ps` CLI (KIP-16 M5) |\n| 🔄 **Sub-agent Reuse** | Sub-agents share the parent pod + workspace; isolat"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"ed reset (KIP-16 M1) |\n| 🧾 **CLI Catalog** | Machine-readable command/flag surface for SDK generatio"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"n — `catalog` (KIP-16 M9) |\n| 🤝 **agent-sandbox compatible** | Works with `kubernetes-sigs/agent-san"},{"id":"p11s16","text":"dbox` |\n| 🔄 **SKILL + CLI + MCP** | AI agents (Claude Code, Codex, Pi) connect via `k8e-sandbox-cli`"},{"id":"p11s17","text":" or the `/k8e-sandbox` skill |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"📚 **Full documentation: k8e.sh/guide** — guides, CLI reference, and examples live on the official si"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"*Full documentation: k8e.sh/guide** — guides, CLI reference, and examples live on the official site."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## 🏗️ Architecture"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"One gateway fronts every operation — session lifecycle, streaming exec,\nfilesystem, PTY terminals, s"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ervice exposure (`expose`), live egress policy\n(`allow-hosts`) and content-addressed snapshots — so "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"agents get one audited\ndoor instead of raw infrastructure access."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Step 1 — Install a Sandbox Runtime (recommended: before K8E)"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**gVisor is recommended** — no KVM required:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"> K8E detects `runsc` at startup and automatically injects the gVisor stanza into its containerd con"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"fig. Do **not** run `runsc install` — K8E manages its own containerd configuration."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> Need stronger isolation? Kata Containers and Firecracker are covered in the Sandbox Runtime Setup "},{"id":"p21s2","text":" stronger isolation? Kata Containers and Firecracker are covered in the Sandbox Runtime Setup guide."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Step 2 — Install K8E"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Step 3 — Verify the Sandbox"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"### Step 4 — Connect Your AI Agent"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Download the standalone sandbox CLI, authenticate, and install the `/k8e-sandbox` skill into your ag"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"load the standalone sandbox CLI, authenticate, and install the `/k8e-sandbox` skill into your agent:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Then ask your agent naturally:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"> \"Run this Python snippet in a sandbox\""},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The agent executes `k8e-sandbox-cli run` automatically — no session management needed."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"> 📖 **Tutorial walkthroughs, the full command reference, and configuration\n> details live in the San"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"dbox CLI guide\n> and Sandbox Examples on the\n> official docs site.**"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## 🆚 K8E vs Other Sandbox Platforms"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| | K8E 🚀 | E2B | Daytona | agent-sandbox | DIY gVisor/Firecracker |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| Self-hosted, single binary | ✅ <100MB | ⚠️ Heavy (per-env VM images) | ✅ | ❌ needs a K8s cluster |"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" ❌ you build it |\n| Isolation runtimes | ✅ **gVisor / Kata / Firecracker** — pluggable | Firecracker"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" microVMs | ✅ microVM/containers | K8s RuntimeClass | one runtime |\n| E2B SDK compatibility | ✅ nati"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"ve (official SDKs unmodified) | ✅ native | ❌ own API | ❌ | ❌ |\n| Warm pool (sub-500ms claims) | ✅ bu"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"ilt-in, adaptive sizing | ✅ managed | ⚠️ | ⚠️ manual scaling | ❌ |\n| Per-session network policy (eBP"},{"id":"p35s6","text":"F) | ✅ Cilium, live-configurable | managed (fixed) | ⚠️ | ⚠️ NetworkPolicy | hand-written |\n| Licens"},{"id":"p35s7","text":"e | Apache 2.0 | Apache 2.0 (hosted core paid) | Apache 2.0 | Apache 2.0 | — |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**When to choose K8E:** you want E2B-style sandboxes but self-hosted, with a rich tool surface beyon"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"d \"run code\" — PTY terminals, snapshots, service exposure, and live egress policy, all through one a"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"PTY terminals, snapshots, service exposure, and live egress policy, all through one audited gateway."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## 🤝 Contributing"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- 🐛 Bug Reports\n- 💡 Feature Requests\n- 🔍 Open PRs"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## 🛡️ Security"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Report vulnerabilities via GitHub Security Advisories. Do not open public issues for security bugs."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"Apache License 2.0 — see LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
